{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12349","headline":"过山人所居因寄诸遗补 · 钱起","name":"过山人所居因寄诸遗补","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空谷春云满，愚公晦迹深。\n一随玄豹隐，几换绿萝阴。\n绝径人稀道，芳荪我独寻。\n厨烟住峭壁，酒气出重林。\n蝴蝶晴还舞，黄鹂晚暂吟。\n所思青琐客，瑶草寄幽心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}